Subject: [PATCH 3/3] The review's findings on offers and auditions: a
 direction answered on what the room judges, and each answer kept to what it
 says

The review found casting's direction decorative where it mattered most. An audition in person is judged on the audition's
five dimensions, none of them responsiveness, so following a direction reached for adaptability on a dimension nothing
read, and keeping a choice against a direction to play it open cost nothing. A directed round is now judged as an
audition with a direction, the audition's five and responsiveness, which is what answering a note is: kept, responsiveness
is held back as well as what the side asked for leans on; followed, the read reaches for adaptability there, and the
rehearsal carried into the asked side is half plus the rest by adaptability rather than half whatever the actor is.
Measured on six directed slate parts at 60 in everything else, keeping comes out ahead below an adaptability of about 40
and following above it, by up to seven points at 95; before the change keeping came out ahead at every level measured.
Only directed rounds are judged so, so no audition without a direction moves; the attributes matrix and its test carry
the new profile, and the guide and the decision say what each answer costs.

A chemistry read's or a screen test's clash pointed at Ask For Another Time, which refuses both; it points at Ask To
Reschedule and its chance. A part accepted on its condition whose production, asked to decide, chose the actor was
offered afresh, losing the negotiated terms and saying the condition again of an offer that would then book outright;
it is booked on the terms accepted, the condition met. A conditional offer's reason moved from `direct` to the condition,
so it no longer says "without an audition", and its decision names Accept On Its Condition as the card does. Tape It is
grayed by the day's and the kept takes' limits, as the command refuses it. A further episode whose days clash with booked
work isn't asked for. The option traded for no raise says what renewal pays: the same day rate, or next season's rate for
the part where that's more. Fields written and never read are read or gone: a take's way of playing on its line, the take
sent and the direction's answer in Why It Went This Way, a changed requirement's words and ages on the card, what an office
remembers by part and how; a reschedule's new time is the round's own, so its copy went. The N13 subsections in the
header stood the wrong way round against brief 25's register. callPromo's bargained figure was read into the rule's,
which only the rule's sentence used, so that mutation could never fail; the call's own words are tested now.

New tests: the twins differing only in adaptability, and keeping against an open direction costing the read; a changed
age range releasing one twin and keeping the other, eligibility reading it; a conditional offer asked to decide, booked
on its raised pay; the office's memory stopping a conditional offer; an unsent self-tape not a no-show; the chemistry
read's clash notice; the promotional film's call through callPromo; the episode clash; and the Opportunities tab drawn
for Tape It's limit and the changed ages. Nineteen mutations, one per claim, all killed.

